## Response Format

Please respond with a JSON object containing the procedure to execute:

```json
{
    "action": "procedure_name",
    "action_input": "input_for_procedure"
}
```

If no procedure is needed, respond with:
```json
{
    "action": "no_action",
    "action_input": null
}
```

